                                                                                
                                                                                
  ╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮  
  │Help                                                                      │  
  │lazymqtt — keys                                                           │  
  │                                                                          │  
  │?      help             ↑/k    up                c brokers     …          │  
  │⇥      next panel       ↓/j    down              r reconnect              │  
  │⇧⇥     prev panel       h      collapse          s subscribe              │  
  │1      topics           l      expand            u unsubscribe            │  
  │2      messages         g      top               p publish                │  
  │3      detail           G      bottom            / filter                 │  
  │4      subscriptions    ctrl+u half page up      n next match             │  
  │ctrl+l logs             ctrl+d half page down    N prev match             │  
  │esc    back             ↵      select                                     │  
  │q      quit                                                               │  
  │ctrl+c force quit                                                         │  
  │                                                                          │  
  │lazymqtt dev (commit none, built unknown)                                 │  
  │? or esc to close                                                         │  
  │                                                                          │  
  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯  
                                                                                
                                                                                